#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:320
msgid "Bridges fan speed"
msgstr "Ventilatorsnelheid voor bruggen"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:325
msgid "This fan speed is enforced during all bridges and overhangs."
msgstr "Deze ventilatorsnelheid wordt aangehouden bij bruggen en overhanging."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:334
msgid "Bridge flow ratio"
msgstr "Brugextrusieverhouding"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:339
msgid ""
"This factor affects the amount of plastic for bridging. You can decrease it "
"slightly to pull the extrudates and prevent sagging, although default "
"settings are usually good and you should experiment with cooling (use a fan) "
"before tweaking this."
msgstr ""
"Deze factor beïnvloedt de hoeveelheid plastic voor bruggen. Deze kan "
"verlaagd worden om het extrudaat strak te trekken en doorzakking te "
"voorkomen. Hoewel de systeemwaarden goed zijn, kan geëxperimenteerd worden "
"met de koeling voor dit aangepast wordt."

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:350
msgid "Single perimeter on top surfaces"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:355
msgid ""
"Use only one perimeter on flat top surface, to give more space to the top "
"infill pattern. Could be applied on topmost surface or all top surfaces."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:359
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:2485
msgid "All top surfaces"
msgstr "Alle bovenvlakken"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:360
#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:2486
msgid "Topmost surface only"
msgstr "Alleen bovenste vlak"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:366
msgid "Only one perimeter on first layer"
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:371
msgid "Use only one perimeter on the first layer."
msgstr ""

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:377
msgid "Bridges"
msgstr "Bruggen"

#: src/slic3r-domain/src/Slic3r/Domain/ConfigDefsFDM.cpp:382
msgid "Speed for printing bridges."
msgstr "Printsnelheid voor bruggen."

